0 -13 Td
() Tj
0 -13 Td
(Problem Statement:) Tj
0 -13 Td
(- Legacy access models trust users after a single authentication. Modern attackers exploit stolen) Tj
0 -13 Td
(credentials, bypass MFA using phishing, and persist inside networks. A Zero Trust system must) Tj
0 -13 Td
(continuously verify identity, device, and behavior.) Tj
0 -13 Td
() Tj
0 -13 Td
(Objective:) Tj
0 -13 Td
(- Build a full-stack platform that:) Tj
0 -13 Td
(  - Learns a behavioral baseline per user) Tj
0 -13 Td
(  - Computes risk scores on every login and session heartbeat) Tj
0 -13 Td
(  - Enforces adaptive policies \(allow, step-up, deny, lock\)) Tj
0 -13 Td
(  - Maps anomalies to MITRE ATT&CK techniques) Tj
0 -13 Td
(  - Provides SOC dashboards for analysts) Tj
0 -13 Td
ET
